### Words both apps show exactly alike: product names, the language's own name, session states and inbox items.
### A word only one app shows goes in mac/ or phone/. Every word that grants or refuses something goes in consent.ftl.

-brand-notchling = Notchling
-brand-claude = Claude
-brand-claude-code = Claude Code
-brand-codex = Codex
-brand-antigravity = Antigravity

## Language

# The language's own name, as its speakers write it. It is the label of this language in the Language row.
language-name = English

## Inbox items

# The result of an inbox item nobody answered in time. Shown in the Inbox.
item-expired = Expired

# The result of an inbox item taken back. Shown in the Inbox.
item-withdrawn = Withdrawn
